7. a) Design a form with various input fields.
b) Implement form validation and error handling.
Forms in Flutter are managed using the Form widget, which acts as a container for grouping,
  validating, and saving multiple input fields. To manage the form's state and trigger actions
  globally, you must assign a GlobalKey<FormState> to its key property.


